# Volume Control Intent
(|set )(the |)music volume to {volume_level}
turn music volume to {volume_level}
change music volume to {volume_level}
make music volume {volume_level}

# With location
set volume to {volume_level} (in|on) (the|) {location}
set (the|) volume to {volume_level} (in|on) (the|) {location}
volume {volume_level} (in|on) (the|) {location}
turn volume to {volume_level} (in|on) (the|) {location}
change volume to {volume_level} (in|on) (the|) {location}
make volume {volume_level} (in|on) (the|) {location}

# Mute/unmute - Padatious generalizes the article and preposition, so one line each (see #30)
(mute|unmute)
(mute|unmute) the (volume|music)
(mute|unmute) (in|on) the {location}
(mute|unmute) the (volume|music) (in|on) the {location}
